WEBVTT

00:00:01.260 --> 00:00:04.000
To the doctor at
Beginning of the World Medical Office.

00:00:04.330 --> 00:00:08.000
This is Yoko.
I'm sending you a letter.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:14.010
I've gotten used to living in our own homemade house.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.810
The Kappa is also getting along with Keita.

00:00:19.420 --> 00:00:23.250
The days together with Keita are very fun.

00:00:25.290 --> 00:00:29.790
Could this be what a newlywed's lifestyle is like?

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.500
<i>Can I keep on praying?</i>

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:42.810
<i>Can I keep on believing?</i>

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:49.750
<i>Oh light that shines</i> <i>in the forest of despair</i>

00:01:00.360 --> 00:01:06.260
<i>I kick the cold ground with my toes</i>

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:13.370
<i>My brushed hair</i> <i>dances in the moonlit night</i>

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:19.940
<i>Let's throw away your</i> <i>frightened eyes and loneliness</i>

00:01:20.310 --> 00:01:27.720
<i>Those days when acting tough</i> <i>was your only friend...</i>

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:32.350
<i>Leave that in the distance</i>

00:01:32.350 --> 00:01:36.260
<i>Is my salvation over there?</i>

00:01:36.260 --> 00:01:39.530
<i>Can I heal this deep darkness?</i>

00:01:39.530 --> 00:01:45.200
<i>Is it okay for me to seek warmth?</i>

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:49.610
<i>I want to be stronger</i> <i>than anyone else</i>

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.880
<i>I want to protect my loved ones</i>

00:01:52.880 --> 00:01:58.980
<i>Oh light that continues</i> <i>to shine on me</i>

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:01.950
to an Aroused Keita!
Returning a Favor

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:04.450
"Returning a Favor to an Aroused Keita!"

00:02:08.860 --> 00:02:09.930
Mr. Keita.

00:02:10.660 --> 00:02:12.130
Oh, the traveling cat.

00:02:12.460 --> 00:02:14.130
Long time no see.

00:02:14.130 --> 00:02:17.130
I know. Glad you're doing fine.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.740
Even a place like this is home to me now.

00:02:23.810 --> 00:02:26.680
Tomekichi, did your tail get fatter?

00:02:26.680 --> 00:02:28.110
No, it didn't.

00:02:28.110 --> 00:02:32.210
Today I brought somebody who really wanted to see you.

00:02:32.210 --> 00:02:35.420
Come. This person is Keita Kawahira.

00:02:37.350 --> 00:02:38.820
A raccoon?

00:02:38.820 --> 00:02:41.660
Umm, I'm here to return a favor.

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.130
A favor?

00:02:43.130 --> 00:02:45.530
It's from around 3 years ago.

00:02:45.530 --> 00:02:49.330
You saved me from a dog on the mountain.

00:02:49.730 --> 00:02:51.400
3 years ago?

00:02:52.070 --> 00:02:53.840
Oh yeah...

00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:07.080
In the name of the wise Hakusan.

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:09.990
Frog, crush just a tiny bit.

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:17.060
Hey, don't bully the weak.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:25.870
That dog was abandoned by humans.

00:03:26.340 --> 00:03:30.740
Humans also made it rage, tattered, and lose trust in everything.

00:03:32.310 --> 00:03:34.980
It's all humans' fault. Sorry.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:45.190
I guess that did happen.

00:03:45.190 --> 00:03:47.660
You really saved my life back then.

00:03:48.060 --> 00:03:49.890
Thank you so much.

00:03:50.360 --> 00:03:53.260
You did a good thing. Good boy.

00:03:53.260 --> 00:03:55.660
It's nothing big.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:59.700
You came all the way from the mountains just to say thanks?

00:03:59.700 --> 00:04:00.970
How faithful.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.070
Not at all.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.810
I'm here right now because of you.

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:08.680
That's why I have to return the favor.

00:04:08.680 --> 00:04:11.980
But it was troubling because
I didn't know who you were.

00:04:11.980 --> 00:04:14.880
That was when I met Mr. Tomekichi.

00:04:14.880 --> 00:04:17.950
When he asked about the one that uses frog erasers,

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:20.520
I thought about you.

00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:23.630
Is that so? But returning a favor is too much.

00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.830
No raccoon can go on without returning a favor.

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:30.170
I will return the favor and be a full-fledged raccoon.

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.970
Raccoons have it tough.

00:04:31.970 --> 00:04:34.600
So, I don't know if you'll like it, but...

00:04:35.070 --> 00:04:36.610
Please take this.

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:38.240
Perfume?

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:39.340
No.

00:04:39.840 --> 00:04:44.480
It has a pill that makes the first person you see fall in love with you.

00:04:44.480 --> 00:04:46.980
This is a love drug.

00:04:46.980 --> 00:04:48.650
I'll take this!

00:04:48.650 --> 00:04:50.250
Teleport.

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:56.990
I won't let you.

00:04:56.990 --> 00:04:59.360
Frog, crush just a tiny bit!

00:05:10.070 --> 00:05:12.610
Oh, no. Why drink it here?

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.580
What's with that attitude?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.980
Look at me.

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:20.350
No. I definitely won't!

00:05:20.350 --> 00:05:22.480
I said look at me.

00:05:23.290 --> 00:05:24.690
Is it a quarrel?

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:26.820
They always do this.

00:05:27.920 --> 00:05:29.730
Humans sure are weird.

00:05:30.060 --> 00:05:32.260
You're so stubborn.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:37.970
Oh, Nadeshiko.
Looking good in your apron again.

00:05:37.970 --> 00:05:39.600
Huh, Nadeshiko?

00:05:43.870 --> 00:05:45.410
I wasted a pill.

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.140
What do you mean by that?

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:51.210
I'm going to use these pills and be the world's most popular guy.

00:05:51.210 --> 00:05:52.820
What did you say?

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.750
Hold on a sec.

00:05:55.180 --> 00:05:59.990
That's weird. It's supposed to take effect immediately.

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:00.960
Well?

00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:04.230
I don't feel any different.

00:06:04.230 --> 00:06:05.960
Does this really work?

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.870
Hey.

00:06:11.170 --> 00:06:12.200
Mr. Raccoon.

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:20.640
What's wrong, all of a sudden?

00:06:20.910 --> 00:06:24.080
Forgive me.
The love drug didn't work.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:29.250
That won't do as a favor.
I'm a failure as a raccoon.

00:06:30.350 --> 00:06:32.050
That's not the case.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:34.360
The thought was enough.

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:35.520
Thanks.

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.730
Mr. Keita.

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:47.000
What's this smell? Miso soup?

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:50.040
Welcome home.

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.680
Would you like to eat? Or take a bath?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:57.750
Otherwise...

00:07:00.380 --> 00:07:01.580
Oh, rubber bands.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:05.590
Don't make me say such a thing in broad daylight.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.820
What do you want?

00:07:08.820 --> 00:07:12.530
Oh Keita, what are you embarrassed about?

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.800
Let's have lunch then. Come inside.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:23.440
It worked. The love drug is working.

00:07:23.440 --> 00:07:26.310
So that's the effect of the love drug.

00:07:27.440 --> 00:07:29.080
Let's eat.

00:07:29.650 --> 00:07:31.680
How does the miso soup taste?

00:07:32.950 --> 00:07:36.920
No matter how much the pill works, surely the taste won't...

00:07:38.590 --> 00:07:40.690
What, this is...

00:07:42.760 --> 00:07:44.190
It's really good.

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:48.700
I'm kind of bad at cooking.

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.770
But I love seeing you enjoy my food.

00:07:51.770 --> 00:07:54.100
That's why I did my best making it.

00:07:54.100 --> 00:07:58.410
Is that so?
You're so great. Let's eat.

00:08:08.520 --> 00:08:10.920
That love drug sure is great.

00:08:10.920 --> 00:08:14.060
It's the first time
I'm seeing its effect too.

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:16.160
This will surely count as a favor.

00:08:21.760 --> 00:08:24.670
This lifestyle might not be so bad.

00:08:24.670 --> 00:08:26.300
Hey, Keita.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:29.840
We're like newlyweds, right?

00:08:29.840 --> 00:08:31.270
Yeah, you're right.

00:08:31.270 --> 00:08:33.540
How many kids do you want?

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:35.440
Kids, huh?

00:08:47.390 --> 00:08:48.890
My dear wife!

00:08:49.560 --> 00:08:53.030
Small happiness is fine too.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:56.130
At this rate, surely my future is...

00:09:04.840 --> 00:09:07.140
Oh, it moved.

00:09:10.210 --> 00:09:11.910
Keita, look.

00:09:12.450 --> 00:09:16.080
Our children are laughing.

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.420
I don't want that!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:24.660
It can't happen!

00:09:25.830 --> 00:09:28.800
Oh Keita, you're so hairy.

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:33.640
Oh my, I'm so sorry.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.300
Where's Keita?

00:09:39.610 --> 00:09:42.040
Is it okay to leave Miss Yoko?

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.910
I prefer human girls.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:49.320
And besides, there's no need to stick to just a small happiness.

00:09:50.020 --> 00:09:51.690
I mean, I got this.

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:55.720
As a human male,
I'll use the heck out of this.

00:09:55.720 --> 00:09:57.430
Yes, sir.

00:09:59.230 --> 00:10:00.530
"Inukami!"

00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:02.730
Woof woof.

00:10:04.800 --> 00:10:06.100
"Inukami!"

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:07.700
Woof woof.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.210
Hey, girls.

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:16.210
Would you like to experience magic?

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.650
What kind?

00:10:17.650 --> 00:10:21.680
Once I count to three, you will fall in love with me.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.320
Let's go.

00:10:25.590 --> 00:10:27.260
One.

00:10:27.260 --> 00:10:28.960
Two.

00:10:29.220 --> 00:10:30.630
Three.

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.130
There.

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:36.730
Oh, he looks like my late husband when he was young.

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:38.870
Looking at him makes me feel hot.

00:10:38.870 --> 00:10:42.070
It's been decades since I've felt like this.

00:10:42.070 --> 00:10:44.370
I'm getting excited.

00:10:44.710 --> 00:10:47.040
Oh, umm...

00:10:49.810 --> 00:10:51.480
Come to my house.

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.450
I saw him first.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:54.750
I was first.

00:10:58.520 --> 00:11:00.020
Mr. Keita.

00:11:03.690 --> 00:11:05.230
Oh, Yoko.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:06.360
How cruel.

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:10.530
I love you so much, but you're going after grandmas.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:13.540
This isn't the time to say that!

00:11:14.570 --> 00:11:16.140
Yoko, use Teleport.

00:11:16.140 --> 00:11:19.270
Use Teleport and teleport everyone far away.

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:22.580
Hurry up, use Teleport.

00:11:22.580 --> 00:11:23.680
Teleport.

00:11:24.150 --> 00:11:25.510
Teleport.

00:11:25.810 --> 00:11:28.050
More. All of them at once!

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.380
Teleport.

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:37.630
Keita?

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:42.830
So you want other women that much, Keita?

00:11:42.830 --> 00:11:46.570
You cheater!

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.040
Grand escape successful.

00:11:54.040 --> 00:11:57.450
I'm sure Miss Yoko would be mad.

00:11:57.450 --> 00:12:00.450
I want to be honest to myself.

00:12:01.420 --> 00:12:03.450
My, is that true?

00:12:03.690 --> 00:12:05.890
Oh, housewives.

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:16.900
Hey, it works on men too?

00:12:16.900 --> 00:12:18.630
I didn't know either.

00:12:32.080 --> 00:12:33.980
That was close.

00:12:36.450 --> 00:12:38.190
Nadeshiko.

00:12:40.360 --> 00:12:42.660
Hey, Nadeshiko.

00:12:44.690 --> 00:12:50.930
Na, de, shi, ko!

00:12:56.610 --> 00:12:58.110
Ouch.

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:08.450
Master Keita, are you all right?

00:13:09.220 --> 00:13:12.320
- If you're hurt...
- We have medicinal herbs.

00:13:12.320 --> 00:13:13.890
Out of the way.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:16.890
There's dirt on your clothing.

00:13:16.890 --> 00:13:18.590
Let me wipe it away.

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:20.730
So it affected them.

00:13:21.030 --> 00:13:23.330
Out of the way, Sendan.

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:25.600
I really wanted this.

00:13:25.600 --> 00:13:28.000
But I'll give this to you. Here.

00:13:28.000 --> 00:13:30.270
I don't really want it...

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:32.210
That's dirty, Tomohane.

00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:34.910
You're bribing
Master Keita with things.

00:13:34.910 --> 00:13:37.350
That's cheeky for the lowest rank.

00:13:37.350 --> 00:13:39.650
That has nothing to do with this.

00:13:39.950 --> 00:13:41.750
Master Keita.

00:13:46.250 --> 00:13:48.160
Let's go, Master Keita.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:50.230
Trying to hog him?

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:52.330
I won't give up Master Keita.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:53.960
That's my line.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:56.130
No, that's my line.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:02.640
Why didn't I care more about you till now?

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:05.170
I shall apologize for that.

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:07.380
Of course, just the two of us.

00:14:09.610 --> 00:14:11.350
This isn't bad.

00:14:11.550 --> 00:14:13.220
Give back Master Keita!

00:14:13.220 --> 00:14:15.080
Give him back!

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:18.490
Don't fight over me, you girls.

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:24.030
Let's make a bright and fun household with the five of us.

00:14:27.200 --> 00:14:34.240
Master Keita.

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:41.680
Right, these girls are dogs too.

00:14:42.380 --> 00:14:43.850
Excuse me.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:47.620
Don't touch me as you like.

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:52.890
We were going out to buy experiment ingredients, right?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.290
Let's go.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:58.590
See you later, Master Keita.

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.930
Did the love drug wear out?

00:15:02.830 --> 00:15:03.900
Master Keita.

00:15:04.670 --> 00:15:06.300
Nadeshiko.

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:09.040
So that's what this pill does.

00:15:09.040 --> 00:15:10.410
Oh, yeah.

00:15:17.880 --> 00:15:22.250
I'll give it back. Don't use it for weird things, Master Keita.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.620
Thanks. I'll be off then.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.420
Maybe I'll regret doing that.

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:33.300
Keita, where are you?

00:15:36.670 --> 00:15:38.500
She's pretty persistent.

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.340
You can't blame her.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.610
By the way, I just don't get the effects of this thing.

00:15:45.310 --> 00:15:48.240
It can take time, work on men,

00:15:48.240 --> 00:15:50.110
and suddenly stop working.

00:15:52.610 --> 00:15:54.450
Keita Kawahira.

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.380
Over here, Keita Kawahira.

00:16:02.960 --> 00:16:05.630
Karina? Don't scare me.

00:16:06.130 --> 00:16:08.530
This is today's work uniform.

00:16:08.530 --> 00:16:10.470
Well, that fits you.

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:12.370
Is that so? It's a bit tight...

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:15.140
What's wrong, Karina?

00:16:15.400 --> 00:16:17.640
Kawahira, please don't laugh.

00:16:18.270 --> 00:16:20.880
I'm ashamed, but this Karina Shiro...

00:16:20.880 --> 00:16:23.650
This is the first time
I've felt this way.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:26.650
The throbbing of my heart.

00:16:27.080 --> 00:16:30.220
My body is hot like my blood's on fire.

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:31.650
I beg of you, Kawahira.

00:16:32.450 --> 00:16:33.960
Move away.

00:16:37.030 --> 00:16:39.560
I love you! I love you!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:44.170
Why are you so passionately red?

00:16:44.170 --> 00:16:45.830
It also works on objects?

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:50.340
Kiss of fire.

00:16:50.970 --> 00:16:51.840
I missed.

00:16:52.410 --> 00:16:53.680
I won't get caught!

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:55.410
Wait.

00:16:59.710 --> 00:17:01.280
Evil Fire.

00:17:07.090 --> 00:17:08.560
No!

00:17:09.760 --> 00:17:11.230
Wait!

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:13.960
Isn't it better if you just apologize?

00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:17.370
If I apologize now,
I will lose my worth as a man.

00:17:17.370 --> 00:17:19.670
I will definitely not give up!

00:17:19.670 --> 00:17:21.040
Evil Blaze.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:36.890
Mr. Keita, you can't run away in that condition.

00:17:37.190 --> 00:17:38.790
I won't give up.

00:17:39.220 --> 00:17:41.660
There's no way I'll give up.

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:43.860
Mr. Keita.

00:17:45.230 --> 00:17:47.060
You can't run anymore.

00:17:49.130 --> 00:17:51.470
Give me the love drug.

00:17:54.270 --> 00:17:56.670
Yoko, you know...

00:17:56.670 --> 00:18:00.780
I've decided that I'll be positive even when I'm down.

00:18:00.780 --> 00:18:01.740
What?

00:18:02.280 --> 00:18:04.880
Raccoon, watch carefully.

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:08.880
This is my way of life.

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:18.630
Mr. Keita. We don't know what'll happen if you do that!

00:18:18.630 --> 00:18:22.460
Whatever happens, it'll be a miracle.

00:18:30.070 --> 00:18:33.270
With this, all the women in the world...

00:18:33.610 --> 00:18:37.750
They shall be mine!

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:54.230
It's here. Here they come.

00:18:54.830 --> 00:18:58.700
All the women in the world are coming for me.

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:00.470
You're right.

00:19:00.470 --> 00:19:02.970
All kinds of women are coming.

00:19:03.510 --> 00:19:06.240
This will be fun to watch, Keita.

00:19:08.280 --> 00:19:10.110
Let's be buried together.

00:19:10.110 --> 00:19:11.150
Let's play.

00:19:11.150 --> 00:19:13.180
Master Keita is best.

00:19:13.180 --> 00:19:14.120
Master Keita.

00:19:14.120 --> 00:19:15.950
Let's play with my free gift.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.690
Kawahira, my love for you is eternal.

00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:30.330
What to do, Mr. Keita?

00:19:30.970 --> 00:19:32.800
There's no need to do anything.

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:35.870
This is what I wanted.

00:19:35.870 --> 00:19:37.470
You better run away.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:39.840
I'll stay and accept all of them.

00:19:40.310 --> 00:19:41.240
Mr. Keita.

00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:42.740
Go now.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:50.750
Now, come.

00:19:51.290 --> 00:19:54.420
Everyone, jump into my arms.

00:19:58.090 --> 00:20:01.900
This is my love!

00:20:12.070 --> 00:20:16.040
I shall carve your way of life into my heart.

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:25.050
Miss Yoko.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:33.390
Welcome home, Keita.

00:20:34.600 --> 00:20:37.870
Yoko, I was mistaken,

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:40.400
trying to be popular by using pills.

00:20:40.740 --> 00:20:42.170
Keita.

00:20:42.170 --> 00:20:43.910
That's why I swear to you.

00:20:44.310 --> 00:20:47.580
From now on,
I'll flirt with my own abilities.

00:20:50.680 --> 00:20:51.710
Evil Fire.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:54.480
Kiss of fire!

00:20:54.680 --> 00:20:58.650
Did the drug really affect Miss Yoko?

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.790
I wonder.

00:20:59.790 --> 00:21:04.430
But perhaps the two of them don't need a love drug.

00:21:04.760 --> 00:21:08.160
Yes. I think I might have bothered them, but...

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:09.430
But?

00:21:09.900 --> 00:21:12.070
Master Keita is so interesting.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.440
So I think it was a good thing.

00:21:14.900 --> 00:21:15.770
Teleport.

00:21:37.860 --> 00:21:43.130
<i>This and that, we want everything</i>

00:21:43.130 --> 00:21:48.540
<i>We wish for love and that all</i> <i>of our dreams will come true</i>

00:21:48.540 --> 00:21:53.680
<i>Every girl is busy</i>

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:58.910
<i>Playing, studying, going crazy</i>
<i>Our schedules are filled</i>

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:02.050
<i>When we are about to be dumped,</i>

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:04.590
<i>we send texts and gather</i>

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:06.990
<i>A meeting at a family restaurant,</i>

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:10.760
<i>and nothing makes any sense</i>

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:13.630
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:13.630 --> 00:22:16.400
<i>We eat some sweets while we chat</i>

00:22:16.400 --> 00:22:21.670
<i>We can't stop, and now</i> <i>our diets are doomed too</i>

00:22:21.670 --> 00:22:24.040
<i>Oh, no. Oh, no. Oh, no</i>

00:22:24.040 --> 00:22:26.740
<i>When we go crazy together,</i>

00:22:26.740 --> 00:22:32.950
<i>we get so excited that we can</i> <i>forget our sadness a bit</i>

00:22:33.250 --> 00:22:35.650
<i>Let's go. Let's go. Fight</i>

00:22:35.650 --> 00:22:38.390
<i>Our hearts are one,</i>

00:22:38.390 --> 00:22:41.960
<i>tied by a strong bond</i> <i>called friendship</i>

00:22:51.200 --> 00:22:54.100
Inukami!

00:22:54.100 --> 00:22:55.040
See you!

00:22:55.100 --> 00:22:56.140
Next episode preview

00:22:56.140 --> 00:22:59.610
In the dead of night, you hear dripping water.

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:02.910
You wake up and check the kitchen, but the faucet is off.

00:23:03.380 --> 00:23:05.950
You feel a strange presence and turn.

00:23:05.950 --> 00:23:07.220
What's waiting there is...

00:23:07.520 --> 00:23:11.090
A) A bloody mannequin with messy hair.

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:14.620
B) A sweaty macho guy who's training.

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:16.390
Now what is your answer?

00:23:16.390 --> 00:23:17.890
Next on Inukami!

00:23:17.890 --> 00:23:25.070
"A Room and Horror Stories and Me!"
